换的预处理指令，就是简单粗暴把别名替换成 int*，不做类型检查"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"typedef 是真正的类型定义，是给指针类型 int *起一个正规别名，会被编译器识别为完整类型"}]},{"ID":"20260509180334-tg1b7k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260509180334-tg1b7k5","updated":"20260509180244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时定义多个变量时效果天差地别"}]},{"ID":"20260509180334-55y6bpg","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4eQ==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260509180334-55y6bpg","updated":"20260509180323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4eQ=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"比如用 #define PINT int* p1，p2\t结果p1是指针，p2只是普通int变量\n但用typedefint*PINT；，写PINT p1，p2；  p1和p2全都是int指针\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-75h8dh6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-75h8dh6","updated":"20260907155526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"static 关键字的作用"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-dyxy3i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-dyxy3i3","updated":"20260907153524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰局部变量时，会把变量的存储位置从栈区改为静态区"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n让它只初始化一次，生命周期延长到整个程序结束，并且保留上一次的值"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rszv21q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rszv21q","updated":"20260907153519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰全局变量或函数时，会限制它们的作用域仅在当前文件内"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n避免不同文件之间同名冲突，实现文件私有化"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gp0wo8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gp0wo8x","updated":"20260907153540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"修饰类的成员变量和成员函数时，让它们属于整个类而非某个对象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n可以不创建对象直接访问\n所有对象共享同一份静态成员，且静态函数不能访问非静态成员"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-wltb528","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-wltb528","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"函数中变量使用 static 的作用"}]},{"ID":"20260907155526-2xkda67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260907155526-2xkda67","updated":"20260907155526"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-h5uvm41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-h5uvm41","updated":"20260907153603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":