制系统都以某种形式支持分支"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用分支意味着你可以把你的工作从开发主线上分离开来进行重大的 Bug 修改、开发新的功能"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以免影响开发主线"}]},{"ID":"20260609091901-pzfi05r","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"Z2l0","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260609091901-pzfi05r","updated":"20260609093231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Z2l0"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"git branch   (查看分支)\ngit branch 分支名\t(新建分支)\ngit checkout 分支名  (切换分支)\n\n合并分支\t\t\t（一个分支上的提交可以合并到另一个分支）\ngit merge 分支名称\n\n删除分支\t\t\t（不能删除当前分支，只能删除其他分支）\ngit branch -d 分支名 （删除分支时，需要做各种检查）\ngit branch -D 分支名  （不做任何检查，强制删除\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260608223436-ff863zp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260608223436-ff863zp","updated":"20260610084108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解决冲突"}]},{"ID":"20260609234427-l97bb8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260609234427-l97bb8o","updated":"20260609234438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260609234438-60m90f5.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260609230622-pzkk2x3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260609230622-pzkk2x3","updated":"20260610084511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开发中分支使用原则与流程"}]},{"ID":"20260610084439-uifm7rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-uifm7rj","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"几乎所有的版本控制系统都以某种形式支持分支。使用分支意味着你可以把你的工作从开发主线上分离开来进行重大的 Bug 修改、开发新的功能，以免影响开发主线。"}]},{"ID":"20260610084439-4g5fq0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-4g5fq0w","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在开发中，一般有如下分支使用原则与流程："}]},{"ID":"20260610084439-cqhmzzc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-cqhmzzc","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260610084439-mktpv8p","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-mktpv8p","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260610084439-7bk1kdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-7bk1kdf","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"master（生产）分支线上分支，主分支，中小规模项目作为线上运行的应用对应的分支；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260610084439-rqas4jx","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-rqas4jx","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260610084439-ssxjd8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-ssxjd8t","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"develop（开发）分支是从 master 创建的分支，一般作为开发部门的主要开发分支，如果没有其他并行开发不同期上线要求，都可以在此版本进行开发，阶段开发完成后，需要是合并到 master 分支，准备上线。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260610084439-j1ueely","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-j1ueely","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260610084439-8ul2m1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260610084439-8ul2m1c","updated":"20260610084439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"feature/xxxx 分支从 develop 创建的分支，一般是