pe":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"视频"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"压缩格式（通过 H.264）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 解码为 YUV 格式 2.YUV→RGB32 转换"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RGB32"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"avcodec_decode_video2、sws_scale"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"视频显示"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[2,2,2,2,2,2],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"音频"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"压缩格式（通过 AAC）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 解码为原始 PCM 2. 根据需要重采样和格式转换"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适合 SDL2 播放的 PCM 格式"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"avcodec_decode_audio4、swr_convert"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"音频播放"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-uk9duqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uk9duqs","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"音视频编码流程（录制）"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-o5vxyyj","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"|媒体类型|输入格式|转换过程|输出格式|核心函数|用途|\n| :------: | :----------------------: | :-----------------: | :------: | :---------: | :--------: |\n|视频|RGB（桌面截图 / 摄像头）|RGB24→YUV420P 转换|YUV420P|sws_scale|H.264 编码|\n|音频|PCM（S16）|S16→FLTP 转换|FLTP|swr_convert|AAC 编码|","TableAligns":[2,2,2,2,2,2],"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-o5vxyyj","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"媒体类型"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入格式"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"转换过程"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出格式"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心函数"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用途"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[2,2,2,2,2,2],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"视频"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RGB（桌面截图 / 摄像头）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RGB24→YUV420P 转换"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YUV420P"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"sws_scale"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"H.264 编码"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[2,2,2,2,2,2],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"音频"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PCM（S16）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"S16→FLTP 转换"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FLTP"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"swr_convert"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","TableCellAlign":2,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AAC 编码"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3m43m6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3m43m6n","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目通过 FFmpeg 实现了核心的音视频编解码功能，而 SDL2 则主要负责音频输出"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jy9o3e3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jy9o3e3","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"介绍一下 RTMP 协议，它在你项目中起什么作用？"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-96urshz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-96urshz","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"推流端和拉流端各自的工作流程是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-sfvk99h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-sfvk99h","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"推流"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"推流端首先通过 Qt 的 QScreen 捕获桌面画面、OpenCV 的 VideoCapture 捕获摄像头画面（支持画中画效果），以及 Qt 的 QAudioInput 采集音频数据。然后将捕获的 RGB 图像通过 FFmpeg 的 sws_scale 转换为 YUV420P 格式，音频数据通过 swr_convert 转换为 FLTP 格式。接着使用 FFmpeg 的 H.264 编码器和 AAC 编码器对音视频数据进行编码，封装为 FLV 格式，并通过 RTMP 协议推送到服务器。推流过程中配置了 RTMP 参数（如缓冲区大小、直播模式）以确保低延迟和稳定性，同时采用多线程处理采集和编码，保证推流流畅。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jzygb1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jzygb1z","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拉流"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉流端首先初始化 FFmpeg 和 SDL2，打开 RTMP 流地址并读取流信息。通过 avformat_find_stream_info 分离视频流和音频流，分别初始化对应的解码器。对视频流，使用 avcodec_decode_video2 解码为 YUV 格式，再通过 sws_scale 转换为 RGB32 格式，通过 Qt 信号槽机制传递给 UI 显示；对音频流，使用 avcodec_decode_audio4 解码为 PCM 格式，通过 SDL2 的音频回调函数进行播放。同时基于时间戳实现音视频同步，处理网络中断和错误（如设置超时回调），确保拉流过程的稳定性和音画同步。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0tnyp7v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0tnyp7v","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"推流 / 拉流过程中，网络中断或抖动时，客户端会有什么表现？你做过哪些重连或错误处理？"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gfs8c24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gfs8c24","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在推流/拉流过程中，当网络中断或抖动时，客户端会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出现卡顿、画面停止或音频中断等现象"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"针对这些问题，我主要做了以下处理：在拉流端，通过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"设置 FFmpeg 的 interrupt_callback 超时回调函数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当网络连接超过 5 秒无响应时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自动中断阻塞操作"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，避免程序卡死；同时在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"avformat_open_input 打开流时进行错误码判断"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，针对 HTTP 和 RTMP 分别输出详细的诊断信息（如检查 Nginx 服务、端口占用、防火墙设置等），帮助快速定位问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-7hkzm0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-7hkzm0p","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在推流端，通过配置 RTMP 优化参数（如 rtmp_buffer 、 tcp_nodelay ）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"减少延迟"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，并在编码和写入过程中使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"av_strerror 捕获详细错误信息"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。此外，项目采用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多线程架构将采集和编码分离"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"配合音视频队列的缓冲机制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，在网络抖动时能够平滑处理数据波动，确保推流的稳定性。虽然项目中未实现自动重连机制，但通过完善的错误日志和状态检测，能够及时发现并处理网络异常。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rxrdedg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rxrdedg","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nginx + RTMP 在这个项⽬⾥具体承担什么职责？【来源：2025 ⾯经-海能达⼀⾯】"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-tky0qn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tky0qn0","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nginx + RTMP 在项目中主要承担流媒体服务器的角色，负责接收推流端的 RTMP 直播流并进行分发。具体来说，推流端通过 FFmpeg 将编码后的音视频数据推送到 Nginx-RTMP 服务器，服务器接收流后可以进行实时转发（供拉流端播放）或录制保存为 FLV 文件供点播使用。Nginx 作为高性能的 Web 服务器，结合 RTMP 模块提供了稳定的流媒体服务，支持多路并发推流和拉流，是项目中实现直播功能的核心基础设施。"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-bwjw6nz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-bwjw6nz","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进阶级"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5l56rd3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5l56rd3","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-12jfwn2","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-12jfwn2","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-fvpwxyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-fvpwxyq","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程池在你项目里是怎么用的？任务队列里存放的是什么粒度的任务？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-5wb94fv","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5wb94fv","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-0fup2p1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0fup2p1","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若同时有大量用户请求视频列表和拉流，线程池如何避免被某一类任务占满，导致其他请求得不到处理？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-3g9gmot","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-3g9gmot","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-n7s0pl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-n7s0pl9","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你的视频自动封面是怎么生成的？关键帧是如何选择的？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jbnfci4","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"4.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":4,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jbnfci4","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-tb9mgnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-tb9mgnf","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MySQL 用来存什么数据？表是如何设计的？说一下你对这个项目中核心表结构的设计。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-t13vxi9","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"5.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":5,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-t13vxi9","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-5l6sw8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-5l6sw8r","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你用什么手段排查过 “播放卡顿” 的问题？从哪些维度去定位是客户端问题还是服务端问题？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-9jdhpvt","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"6.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":6,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-9jdhpvt","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-vqswhvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vqswhvs","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你项目中有没有用到设计模式？比如在管理播放状态、网络连接、配置等方面，用过什么模式？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-cvsj0fo","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"7.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":7,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-cvsj0fo","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-q4h668r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-q4h668r","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如何保证一个用户在多个终端登录时，观看历史和点赞数据是一致的？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-kpx9ckb","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"8.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":8,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-kpx9ckb","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-2yqty2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-2yqty2n","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当主播⽹络不稳定时，直播间⾥观众会有哪些感知？你在项⽬⾥是如何处理断流和重连的？"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-m0w5vue","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-m0w5vue","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深入级"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-pl2g229","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-pl2g229","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-qpukdkj","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-qpukdkj","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-wrqkm2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-wrqkm2l","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在高并发拉流场景下，如何评估你的 Nginx + RTMP 部署能承受多大并发量？你如何做容量评估和压测？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-hyaqfih","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hyaqfih","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-hp3zlej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hp3zlej","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若有大量用户在同一时间点刷新视频列表，你对数据库的高并发访问有什么优化手段？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-kp25qk1","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-kp25qk1","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-txym1l7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-txym1l7","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如何设计一个缓存机制来减少热门视频信息对数据库的压力？是否考虑过 LRU 或其他缓存淘汰策略？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-rq0s44i","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"4.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":4,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rq0s44i","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-uc6kyhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-uc6kyhk","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果将短视频平台做成分布式系统，多台推流 / 拉流服务器之间如何做负载均衡和故障切换？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-yelgsfh","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"5.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":5,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-yelgsfh","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-gjnbard","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gjnbard","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若未来要引入 HTTP/3 / QUIC 来优化播放连接建立延迟，你认为相较当前 RTMP/TCP 方案，会有哪些变化？"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-c1bsipf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-c1bsipf","updated":"20260505170804"}},{"ID":"20260505170804-d6xwg49","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-d6xwg49","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三、面试复习清单"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-dpqi02h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-dpqi02h","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基础必背"}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-gfdtw9o","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-gfdtw9o","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-hg49oo8","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hg49oo8","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-vyb7qbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-vyb7qbc","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你能系统地讲一下你短视频平台项目的整体架构和数据流吗？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-z83h6so","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-z83h6so","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-hjf62i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-hjf62i3","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RTMP 协议的基本概念和作用是什么？在你的项目里承担了哪些职责？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-0b6fzis","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-0b6fzis","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-s06zonz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-s06zonz","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何简单描述 FFmpeg 的作用？你在项目中用到了它的哪些模块（解复用、解码、编码等）？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-jsdddrt","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"4.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":4,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-jsdddrt","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260505170804-rgap7gt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260505170804-rgap7gt","updated":"20260505170804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"epoll 与 select/poll 的主要区别是什么？为什么高并发场景更推荐 epoll？"}]}]},{"ID":"20260505170804-swsvkro","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"5.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":5,"Delimiter"